{"data": [{"author_id": "14562968", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:40:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113385128248385884"], "id": "2113385128248385884", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 2081, "like_count": 22, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body\n\nApplication of the high-precision technique is part of a clinical trial to treat a genetic disease that can cause liver and nerve damage.\n\nhttps://t.co/ofhBnVXUJk", "url": "https://x.com/weldeiry/status/2113385128248385884"}, {"author_id": "895032812457181184", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:38:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113399619313082871"], "id": "2113399619313082871", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 283, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "突发新闻：人类首次\"体内直接\"改写基因——新一代基因编辑 prime editing 走进人体\n\n据 Nature 今日报道，生物技术公司 Prime Medicine 已在本月完成全球首例人体体内 prime editing 治疗：直接对患者肝脏细胞改写 DNA，修复导致威尔逊病（铜代谢障碍罕见病）的一个基因突变。该技术比传统 CRISPR-Cas9", "url": "https://x.com/francia781119/status/2113399619313082871"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113380233017491456"]}, "author_id": "2110354767163629570", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:21:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113380267142324416"], "id": "2113380267142324416", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113355702345363659", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Prime editing works inside a human body for the first time\n\nA high-precision gene-editing method, prime editing, has rewritten DNA directly inside a patient for the first time. In a Prime Medicine trial for Wilson disease, it fixed a mutation in liver cells that stops the body https://t.co/vo5C32MaWi https://t.co/GZKkobon1S", "url": "https://x.com/TwilightSignals/status/2113380267142324416"}, {"author_id": "2097860142490357761", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:10:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113392471132786989"], "id": "2113392471132786989", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Prime editing, a high-precision form of gene editing, has been used to rewrite DNA directly inside a person's body, the first known instance of such a treatment, Nature reports.\n\nPrime Medicine treated the first person in its clinical trial for Wilson disease earlier this month,", "url": "https://x.com/PureGoodNews/status/2113392471132786989"}, {"author_id": "1580408538119417856", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:29:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113382134920683539"], "id": "2113382134920683539", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 211, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "高精度ゲノム編集法「prime editing」をヒト体内で直接用いる初の治療が臨床試験で実施され、肝障害や神経障害を引き起こす遺伝性疾患を対象に、DNAを切断せず狙った配列を書き換える治療の実用化に向けた進展を紹介した記事がNature誌に掲載されました。\nhttps://t.co/uh9p0dENHE", "url": "https://x.com/iPatho1/status/2113382134920683539"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113385935475773441", "3_2113385935530295296"]}, "author_id": "3235441782", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:44:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113385937912689109"], "id": "2113385937912689109", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1602, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "This microfluidic device squeezes cells as they pass through, loosening their tightly packed DNA so CRISPR tools can reach and switch on genes to make cell reprogramming more efficient. 🧫🧬\n\n🔗 https://t.co/udwB9cSLYa\n\n#ResearchPowersProgresss #CellReprogramming #CRISPR https://t.co/BRWH8iUmLq", "url": "https://x.com/UCLAstemcell/status/2113385937912689109"}, {"author_id": "2110078670496768000", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:58:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113404718672212399"], "id": "2113404718672212399", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "If all was legal would you be okay with performing CRISPR gene editing if you found out your child had a disability?", "url": "https://x.com/Hgucci227227/status/2113404718672212399"}, {"author_id": "397317974", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:41:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113400399483064709"], "id": "2113400399483064709", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 439, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "New Research: CRISPR diagnostics for maternal–infant HIV, hepatitis B, and syphilis care: clinical roles and translational gaps www.​frontiersin.​org/articles/10.​3389/fmicb.​2026.​1977927 #FrontiersIn #Microbiology", "url": "https://x.com/FrontMicrobiol/status/2113400399483064709"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113404542226161664"]}, "author_id": "95439667", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:58:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113404546982555850"], "id": "2113404546982555850", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 309, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#AI model finds #CRISPR-like #DNA pattern https://t.co/uVa5ObvlCV https://t.co/cDm5WutaGT", "url": "https://x.com/ChEnected/status/2113404546982555850"}, {"author_id": "374095894", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:11:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113392765048328553"], "id": "2113392765048328553", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 144, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A powerful gene-editing technique has been used to edit DNA directly in a person’s body — the first known instance of such a treatment.\n\n#geneediting #CRISPR \n https://t.co/qbFT2EpIK5", "url": "https://x.com/TeselaGen/status/2113392765048328553"}, {"author_id": "1133264045606297600", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:16:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113378878320525772"], "id": "2113378878320525772", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "これね\n同社が公開した世界最大規模の「800万細胞脳内CRISPRアトラス」は、個人でも完全に無料でダウンロードできます。\n\nhttps://t.co/2UKo5k6SYl\n\n•Hugging FaceのPerturbAIリポジトリから全データを取得可能です。\n\nhttps://t.co/CNCN5Q01Wl", "url": "https://x.com/Tanatosu_DP04/status/2113378878320525772"}, {"author_id": "2013464153931788288", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:57:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113389346048905710"], "id": "2113389346048905710", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A OpenAI pôs quase 2.000 agentes pra analisar um atlas CRISPR do cérebro de camundongo. Em 32 minutos saíram hipóteses sobre doenças neurodegenerativas.\n\nSe o agente produz rápido assim, o gargalo vira validar.\n\nQuem confere o trabalho dos agentes no seu time?", "url": "https://x.com/ryahconstantino/status/2113389346048905710"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113383825162260480"]}, "author_id": "146108201", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:35:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113383860692217972"], "id": "2113383860692217972", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenAI agents did months of mouse-brain work in 32 minutes\n\nOpenAI teamed with PerturbAI and Scripps Research to run thousands of agents on GPT-Rosalind against a whole-brain CRISPR atlas — how gene edits hit different mouse-brain cell types. Full pass: 32 minutes. Same job by https://t.co/IG9FBiGWVM", "url": "https://x.com/Tesla_Optimus_K/status/2113383860692217972"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113397485750149121"]}, "author_id": "760529971", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113397489969607094"], "id": "2113397489969607094", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 174, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "New bench space. New workflows. New possibilities. 🚀\nIf your lab is growing, the Synthego New Lab Startup Program can help you get the eligible molecular biology + CRISPR products you need.\n👉 Explore the program: https://t.co/Pvo8SVwyd1 https://t.co/sL4qRCN3pE", "url": "https://x.com/Synthego/status/2113397489969607094"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["16_2113384624718274560"]}, "author_id": "24828810", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:22:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113395639224770872"], "id": "2113395639224770872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 415, "impression_count": 119231, "like_count": 773, "quote_count": 13, "reply_count": 29, "retweet_count": 150}, "text": "Delighted to share a landmark preprint from our lab, using genome language models and AI agents for biological discovery and genome mining!\n\nThe stretches of DNA between protein-coding genes are often called the genome’s “dark matter,” but they are far from empty. They encode RNA https://t.co/UDPiMjXRGd", "url": "https://x.com/pdhsu/status/2113395639224770872"}, {"author_id": "1537400804113408000", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113389937471225941"], "id": "2113389937471225941", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A baby in Philadelphia became the first person in the world treated with a CRISPR gene therapy designed only for him. He was born with a rare disease that lets ammonia build up in the body, and after treatment he is growing well and thriving.\n\nThis is a world first. The therapy", "url": "https://x.com/maxmcnichh/status/2113389937471225941"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113374837817446596"], "id": "2113374837817446596", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 379, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "\"Structure-guided discovery and engineering of miniature CRISPR-Cas12m for epigenome editing\"\nYu T, Ji M, Yu D, Guan Z, Zhu R [..] Xiang K, Bai L, Li K.\n(bioRxiv 2026-03-28) Nat Struct Mol Biol. 2026-09-16.\nhttps://t.co/2W7eEYy7sE\nP. methylotrophicum Cas12m (PmCas12m) (601 aa)", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceCrisp/status/2113374837817446596"}, {"author_id": "2028462276840419328", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:08:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113392063714873764"], "id": "2113392063714873764", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 101, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "차세대 반도체는 어쩌면 생명공학일지도 모른다.\n\n20세기가 석유의 시대였다면,\n21세기 전반은 반도체의 시대였다.\n\n그렇다면 그다음은?\n\n나는 바이오 산업을 주목하고 있다.\n\n반도체가 전자를 통제해 세상을 바꿨다면,\n생명공학은 세포와 유전자를 제어해 세상을 바꾸려 한다.\n\n과거에는 질병을", "url": "https://x.com/InvestorToSiL/status/2113392063714873764"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113381402620428288", "3_2113381402620403712"]}, "author_id": "1668873658927054848", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:26:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113381412527296771"], "id": "2113381412527296771", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 936, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "伯克利学段前两天，印象最深的是宇宙和基因编辑两堂课。\n\nAlex Filippenko 是 2011 https://t.co/kYjk3u0wTH", "url": "https://x.com/wulujia/status/2113381412527296771"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2113380233017491456", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113385935475773441", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113385935530295296", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113404542226161664", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113383825162260480", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113397485750149121", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "16_2113384624718274560", "type": "animated_gif"}, {"media_key": "3_2113381402620428288", "type": "photo"}, {"media_key": "3_2113381402620403712", "type": "photo"}], "users": [{"id": "14562968", "name": "Wafik S. El-Deiry, MD, PhD, FACP", "username": "weldeiry"}, {"id": "895032812457181184", "name": "美股风向标/Market Impulse", "username": "francia781119"}, {"id": "2110354767163629570", "name": "Twilight Signals", "username": "TwilightSignals"}, {"id": "2097860142490357761", "name": "Pure Good News", "username": "PureGoodNews"}, {"id": "1580408538119417856", "name": "谷口研究室（北海道大学医学部 統合病理学教室）", "username": "iPatho1"}, {"id": "3235441782", "name": "UCLA Broad Stem Cell", "username": "UCLAstemcell"}, {"id": "2110078670496768000", "name": "Hgucci227", "username": "Hgucci227227"}, {"id": "397317974", "name": "Frontiers - Microbiology", "username": "FrontMicrobiol"}, {"id": "95439667", "name": "American Institute of Chemical Engineers (AIChE)", "username": "ChEnected"}, {"id": "374095894", "name": "TeselaGen Biotechnology", "username": "TeselaGen"}, {"id": "1133264045606297600", "name": "naps43_22", "username": "Tanatosu_DP04"}, {"id": "2013464153931788288", "name": "Ryan Constantino", "username": "ryahconstantino"}, {"id": "146108201", "name": "Tesla_Optimus", "username": "Tesla_Optimus_K"}, {"id": "760529971", "name": "Synthego", "username": "Synthego"}, {"id": "24828810", "name": "Patrick Hsu", "username": "pdhsu"}, {"id": "1537400804113408000", "name": "Maximilian McNicholas", "username": "maxmcnichh"}, {"id": "818008252814217217", "name": "CRISP_SCIENCE", "username": "ScienceCrisp"}, {"id": "2028462276840419328", "name": "투자쟁이 토실이", "username": "InvestorToSiL"}, {"id": "1668873658927054848", "name": "luca wu", "username": "wulujia"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2113404718672212399", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlwtp29zktgyqha